      "The time for the test has come.",
      "",
      "Actually, I know your skill is not perfect yet, ",
      "and prepared something to help you with it. But ",
      "you should pass the test first.",
      "",
      "Go into the Beehive Cave and hunt 20 Dire Bees ",
      "to come back to me, then you will pass the test. ",
      "I bet it will not be such hard for you.",
      "",
      "Now, leave for your quest!"
